 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">今週は➡</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 22px;"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"></span><strong><span style="font-size: 22px;">　　　　 ～</span></strong></span><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">「</font><font color="#000000" face="Roboto, RobotoDraft, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">サステナクイズ海洋環境編」をやってみよう</span></font></span></strong><strong style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">～</span></strong></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 8px;"></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font color="#000000" face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14px;"></span></font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14px;">楽しい思い出、はたまた悲しい気持ちを慰めてもらったり、海が人生の一部という方も沢山いますよね。</span></font></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;">そんな私たちの生活を支える海ですが、プラスチックごみの流出などの環境問題を抱えていることも聞いたことがあるのではないでしょうか？</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;">「聞いたことあるけど、詳しくは知らない」という方向けに、海洋環境について学べるクイズを作りました。</p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify;">海を守るサステナブルなブランドもいくつがご紹介しているので是非挑戦してみてください！</p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">KAPOK KNOTのInstagramでもメンバーのチャレンジを発信していきます 。</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kapok_knot_jp/" style="max-width: 100%; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: underline; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message"><strong>@kapok_knot_jp</strong></a>をタグ付けして<strong>#kapokaction</strong>で是非SNSに投稿お願いいたします！</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" id="e-1630196998779" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-gpicon-button" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1630196998779"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-stretch-lg="0"><a class="button btn gf_button" href="https://kapok-knot.typeform.com/to/wY0dpOXs?typeform-source=www.klaviyo.com" target="" data-scroll-speed="2000" data-exc="" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message"><span>サステナクイズ~海洋環境編~はこちらから</span></a></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1630197023989" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630197023989"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1630197024090" data-id="1630197024090"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1630197034505" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1630197034505" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/c4597c26-b0a4-4f88-a